{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>這家Claude聊天機械人開發商上市第二日早盤股價最低跌至87.26美元，使其較83美元IPO發行價的漲幅一度縮窄至僅5.1%。該股周四開盤後迅速上漲，一度推動Anthropic市值超過亞馬遜，隨後開始回落。</p>\n<p>股價下跌之際，所謂超額配售選擇權、即「綠鞋機制」也被行使，使承銷銀行得以額外出售股份。計入超額配售後，Anthropic以及在此次發行中出售股份的聯合創始人合計籌資規模增至1，195億美元，其中IPO籌資935億美元，同期私募配售籌資260億美元。</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://n.sinaimg.cn/finance/transform/116/w550h366/20261120/1ea2-84136278f3289e3d5dea661787f1c534.jpg\">\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://n.sinaimg.cn/finance/transform/116/w550h366/20261120/1ea2-84136278f3289e3d5dea661787f1c534.jpg\">\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T16:44:23.407031+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":229,"images":2,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T16:02:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T08:57:13.882056+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T16:37:38.158739+00:00","content_hash":"ea5eec513123fd3fe5a0849ae5b747315e90b849d31ed3b1dec3eb5c19ba2d18","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T16:44:23.407031+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}